Uniswap V3 Core and Periphery — Vendored Source Notice
======================================================

This package vendors unmodified production Solidity from the official Uniswap V3
repositories. Source was copied into `contracts/core/` and `contracts/periphery/`
excluding upstream `contracts/test/` directories.

