@uniswap/v3-core import resolution
----------------------------------
Periphery imports use `@uniswap/v3-core/contracts/...`. No registry package is
installed. Hardhat compile remapping in `hardhat.config.ts` maps that prefix to
the vendored tree at `contracts/core/`. Core implementation artifacts are pulled
into the build via `contracts/bootstrap/CoreImports.sol`.
